  "term": "Asperger’s disorder",
  "definition": "Asperger’s disorder is a childhood-onset condition marked by ongoing difficulty with two-way social communication and interaction, along with restricted and repetitive behaviors, interests, or activities. These features can interfere with everyday functioning.",
